---
// Error wrapping tree traversal: fmt.Errorf(%w) + errors.Join -> errors.Is / errors.As.
const W = 900;
const H = 290;
---
<figure class="gfetw">
  <div class="gfetw-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Diagram tracing how fmt.Errorf(%w) wrapping errors.Join builds an error tree searched depth-first by errors.Is and errors.As.">
      {/* Left: Error tree graph */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="448" height="262" rx="10" class="gfetw-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gfetw-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Wrapping tree built by %w + errors.Join</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Cây lỗi tạo bởi %w và errors.Join</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="92" y="58" width="292" height="44" rx="6" class="gfetw-box" />
      <text x="238" y="77" text-anchor="middle" class="gfetw-b">fmt.Errorf("checkout: %w", joined)</text>
      <text x="238" y="94" text-anchor="middle" class="gfetw-m">Unwrap() error -&gt; returns joined</text>

      <line x1="238" y1="102" x2="238" y2="124" class="gfetw-edge" />

      <rect x="92" y="124" width="292" height="44" rx="6" class="gfetw-box" />
      <text x="238" y="143" text-anchor="middle" class="gfetw-b">errors.Join(io.EOF, &amp;TimeoutErr{'{}'})</text>
      <text x="238" y="160" text-anchor="middle" class="gfetw-m">Unwrap() []error -&gt; returns 2 children</text>

      <line x1="176" y1="168" x2="128" y2="196" class="gfetw-edge" />
      <line x1="300" y1="168" x2="348" y2="196" class="gfetw-edge" />

      <rect x="30" y="196" width="192" height="64" rx="6" class="gfetw-box is-ok" />
      <text x="126" y="217" text-anchor="middle" class="gfetw-b-ok">[0] io.EOF (sentinel)</text>
      <text x="126" y="236" text-anchor="middle" class="gfetw-m">errors.Is(err, io.EOF)</text>
      <text x="126" y="252" text-anchor="middle" class="gfetw-b-ok">-&gt; TRUE</text>

      <rect x="242" y="196" width="204" height="64" rx="6" class="gfetw-box is-ok" />
      <text x="344" y="217" text-anchor="middle" class="gfetw-b-ok">[1] *TimeoutErr{'{Op, Ms}'}</text>
      <text x="344" y="236" text-anchor="middle" class="gfetw-m">errors.As(err, &amp;te)</text>
      <text x="344" y="252" text-anchor="middle" class="gfetw-b-ok">-&gt; extracts Ms=250</text>

      {/* Right: %w vs %v trap */}
      <rect x="478" y="14" width="408" height="262" rx="10" class="gfetw-card" />
      <text x="494" y="42" class="gfetw-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Why %w preserves identity while %v severs it</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Khác biệt giữa %w (nối cây) và %v (cắt chuỗi)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="494" y="58" width="376" height="92" rx="6" class="gfetw-box is-ok" />
      <text x="508" y="80" class="gfetw-b-ok">fmt.Errorf("query: %w", err)  (Go 1.13+)</text>
      <text x="508" y="100" class="gfetw-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Implements Unwrap() for errors.Is / errors.As checks.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Giữ hàm Unwrap() để tầng trên dò đúng lỗi bằng Is/As.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="508" y="120" class="gfetw-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Supports multiple %w in one string (Go 1.20+): Unwrap() []error.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Từ Go 1.20 viết được nhiều %w trên cùng câu fmt.Errorf!</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="494" y="166" width="376" height="94" rx="6" class="gfetw-box is-red" />
      <text x="508" y="188" class="gfetw-b-red">fmt.Errorf("query: %v", err)  (string-only)</text>
      <text x="508" y="208" class="gfetw-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Formats text once and drops the inner error pointer completely.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ in thành chữ rồi vứt luôn con trỏ lỗi gốc bên trong.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="508" y="228" class="gfetw-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Intentional at API borders when hiding DB details.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Dùng ở biên API ngoài khi muốn ẩn chi tiết DB nội bộ.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>errors.Is and errors.As walk Unwrap() error and Unwrap() []error links depth-first, so %w preserves machine-checkable error trees across service layers while %v intentionally snaps the chain cleanly at public borders.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>errors.Is và errors.As duyệt cây theo chiều sâu qua Unwrap() error và Unwrap() []error: dùng %w để giữ nguyên danh tính lỗi nội bộ, còn %v chủ đích cắt đứt liên kết khi xuất thông báo ra API ngoài.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gfetw { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gfetw-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gfetw svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 680px; height: auto; }
  .gfetw text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gfetw-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gfetw-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gfetw-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gfetw-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gfetw-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gfetw-edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gfetw-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gfetw-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gfetw-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gfetw-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gfetw-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gfetw-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gfetw figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
